      "title": "Comic Factory - How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Deterministic lettering production graph\n\nThis workflow renders four independent Illustrious panels, assembles a clean 2x2 page, then sends the page through one real custom node: `IllustriousComicLettering4Panel`. Diffusion does not draw the dialogue.\n\n### Test order\n1. Install ComfyUI-IllustriousComicLettering.\n2. Select the Illustrious checkpoint and character LoRAs.\n3. Leave each panel prompt free of bubble or text requests.\n4. Queue once and inspect the four raw panels.\n5. Edit the four exact dialogue fields in the lettering node.\n6. Save the deterministic lettered page."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
