      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Character Bible",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Two-character identity lock\n\n**YUI01 / yuichan:** pure black long hair, hair between eyes, brown eyes; keep her on the left.\n\n**LALA01 / lalachan:** pure pink very long hair, ahoge, teal eyes, hair ornament, demon tail; keep her on the right.\n\n**Shared uniform:** yellow sweater vest, collared white shirt, green bowtie, short sleeves, green plaid pleated miniskirt.\n\nRepeat the complete identity and shared-uniform block without changing its order in all four prompts."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
