      "title": "ENGLISH PROMPT GUIDE - READ FIRST",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## PROMPT GUIDE - ART ONLY\n\nEach panel prompt describes identity, clothing, shot, location, action, emotion, lighting, and a clear area for later lettering.\n\nDo not request words or a speech bubble from Illustrious. End every prompt with: `clean uncluttered negative space near the top, no speech bubble, no letters, no text`.\n\nThe post-process node supplies exact horizontal Latin dialogue after page assembly, so spelling no longer changes with the seed."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
